s with the user’s remaining HP and is given by `150 * HP / max HP`, to a maximum of 150 when the user has full HP.","learners":{"level":[[895,17301504]]}},"821":{"description":"The user shoots its psychic power from its eyes to attack. This may also leave the target frozen.","effect":"Inflicts regular damage. Has a chance to freeze the target.\n\nDuring Hail, this move has 100% accuracy. It also has a (100 - accuracy)% chance to break through the protection of Protect and Detect.","learners":{"level":[[144,17301504]]}},"822":{"description":"The user transforms its wrath into a fire-like aura to attack. This may also make opposing Pokémon flinch.","effect":"Inflicts regular damage. Has a chance to make the target flinch.","learners":{"level":[[146,17301504]]}},"823":{"description":"The user overwhelms the target with lightning-like movement before delivering a kick. This also lowers the target's Defense stat.","effect":"Inflicts regular damage. Lowers the target’s Defense by one stage.","learners":{"level":[[145,17301504]]}},"824":{"description":"The user attacks by hurling a blizzard-cloaked icicle lance at opposing Pokémon.","effect":"Inflicts regular damage.","learners":{"level":[[898,17301504]]}},"825":{"description":"The user attacks by sending a frightful amount of small ghosts at opposing Pokémon.","effect":"Inflicts regular damage.","learners":{"level":[[898,17301504]]}},"826":{"description":"The user attacks with its tremendous psychic power. This also drains 3 PP from the move last used by the target.","effect":"The target loses 3 PP from the last move it used.","learners":{"level":[[199,17301504]]}},"827":{"description":"The user lashes out at the target with ruinous claws. This may also leave the target poisoned, paralyzed, or asleep.","effect":"","learners":{"level":[[903,25165824]]}},"828":{"description":"Cloaking itself in psychic energy, the user slams into the target. This also boosts the user’s Defense stat.","effect":"","learners":{"egg":[[234,16777216]],"level":[[234,8388608],[899,25165824]]}},"829":{"description":"The user swaps its Attack and Defense stats.","effect":"","learners":{"tutor":[[628,8388608],[713,8388608]]}},"830":{"description":"The user swings its stone axes at the target. Stone splinters left behind by this attack float around the target.","effect":"","learners":{"level":[[900,25165824]]}},"831":{"description":"The user attacks by wrapping opposing Pokémon in fierce winds brimming with love and hate. This may also lower their Attack stats.","effect":"","learners":{"level":[[905,25165824]]}}}